# --- end of jump course sc ---

quest title=The Rooftops
quest intro=A beacon on drowned rooftops, still calling: "Commons sealed. Do not answer." Climb onto the beacon roof.
step reach|beacon|1|Climb onto the beacon roof in the middle
step read|Pelagic Network distress card|1|Read the distress card in the beacon hut
step kill|Screecher|3|Drive the screechers off the beacon
step blueprint|Blueprint_Reciever|1|Take the receiver plans from the beacon hut's chest
step blueprint|Blueprint_Antenna|1|Take the antenna plans from the toolbox on the bridge by the beacon
step read|Rooftop caretaker's diary|1|Read the caretaker's diary in the roof garden
step read|Ines's slate (the coop)|1|Find the diver's slate by the hen coop on its roof
step reach|sc_ridge|1|Climb the rubble ridge with the old signal poles
step read|Pump-man's slate|1|Read the slate in the pump-man's ruin, a small house on the rubble
step read|Courier's logbook|1|Read the logbook at the crashed courier plane
step collect|story:sc_key|1|Dive into the drowned telephone exchange pit and open its strongbox for the key
step reach|sc_summit|1|Climb Signal Hill, the tall hill with the linemen's tower
step open|Relay locker|1|Open the relay locker with the exchange key
step read|Ines's slate (Signal Hill)|1|Read the diver's slate on Signal Hill
step reach|jump_sc_top|1|Hop up the caretaker's slab scaffold by the water and look for the highway from its top
quest done=Ines went down the road after her son's shuttle, and Teo after her with the oxygen. The Receiver finds the toll booth's radio on band 700.
quest reward=Plank*8;Rope*3;OxygenBottle*1;Flipper*1

save Spirecrest Roofs
